[0.001, "o", "y not available for remote plugin\r\u001b[3C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m⚠ \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3mMake sure you trust a plugin before installing, updating, or using it. Anthropic does not control what MCP servers, files, or other software are included in \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bplugins and cannot verify that they will work as intended or that they won't change. See each plugin's homepage for more information.\r\u001b[3C\u001b[2B\u001b[23m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[6GInstall for you (user scope)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39mInstall\u001b[14Gfor\u001b[18Gall\u001b[22Gcollaborators\u001b[36Gon\u001b[39Gthis\u001b[44Grepository\u001b[55G(project\u001b[64Gscope)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BInstall\u001b[14Gfor\u001b[18Gyou,\u001b[23Gin\u001b[26Gthis\u001b[31Grepo\u001b[36Gonly\u001b[41G(local\u001b[48Gscope)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BOpen\u001b[11Ghomepage\r\u001b[1B     View on GitHub\u001b[K\r\u001b[3C\u001b[1B  Back to plugin list\u001b[K\r\u001b[3C\u001b[2B \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Esc to go back\u001b[39m\u001b[40;1H\u001b[33;4H\u001b[?2026l"]
