[1.975, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[31B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m* /agent-skills:code-review-and-quality – (agent-skills) Conducts multi-axis code review. Use before merging any change. Use when reviewing code written by yours…\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m* /agent-skills:review – (agent-skills) Conduct a five-axis code review — correctness, readability, architecture, security, performance\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B* /agent-skills:test – (agent-skills) Run TDD workflow — write failing tests, implement, verify. For bugs, use the Prove-It pattern.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B* /agent-skills:build – (agent-skills) Implement tasks incrementally — build, test, verify, commit. Add \"auto\" to run the whole plan in one approved pass.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B* /agent-skills:plan – (agent-skills) Break work into small verifiable tasks with acceptance criteria and dependency ordering\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[39m/\r\u001b[38C\u001b[2B\u001b[K\u001b[40;1H\u001b[38;4H\u001b[?25h\u001b[?2026l"]
