[0.187, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[2;35r\u001b[2S\u001b[r\u001b[H\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m▝▜\u001b[48;2;0;0;0m█████\u001b[49m█▀\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mOpus 5.5 · Claude Pro\r\u001b[19B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m⏺\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mWrote\u001b[12G\u001b[1m175\u001b[16G\u001b[22mlines\u001b[22Gto\u001b[25G\u001b[1maddy/SPEC.md\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m  1 \u001b[22m# Spec: Expense Splitter API\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  2 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B  3 \u001b[22mStatus: **DRAFT — awaiting approval**\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  5 \u001b[22m## Assumptions (correct any of these before approval)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  6 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B  7 \u001b[22m1. **No authentication.** \"Any member can record an expense\" means the API trusts the caller; payer and participants must be members of the group, but\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m caller identity is not verified.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  9 \u001b[22m3. **One currency per group, 2 decimal places** (e.g. EUR). No currency conversion. Currency code is stored for display only; default `EUR`.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 10 \u001b[22m4. **Money travels as decimal strings** in JSON (`\"10.00\"`), never JSON numbers, so clients can't introduce fl"]
[0.002, "o", "oat error. Internally all money is **int\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22meger cents**.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m… +174 li\u001b[16Ges \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✳\u001b[3GBrewing… \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(59s · ↓\u001b[21G5.8k tokens)\r\u001b[1B  ⎿  Tip: Use /btw to ask a quick side question without interrupting Claude's current work\u001b[39m\u001b[40;1H\u001b[38;3H\u001b[?25h\u001b[?2026l"]
